                  <span class="font-medium text-ink">{row.party}</span>
                  <span class="col-start-2 text-sm text-ink-muted leading-snug sm:col-start-3">{row.check}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              Only once every checkpoint is confirmed does a shipment move from
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink">awaiting_readiness</span> to
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink">ready</span>, and only then can it
              be scheduled. This was the first thing I asked engineering to build, so a
              courier could never be sent before a clinic was actually ready.
            </p>
          </div>

          <figure class="my-12 border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <blockquote class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight text-ink leading-snug">
