              or a status should look.
            </p>
            <p>
              So I started the redesign with an audit of the front end instead of a new
              mockup. The goal was a calm, consistent, trustworthy app that kept the
              brand, every route, and every form field name, so nothing the team or
              their customers relied on would move.
